Z||000000||1FieroGTRacingInc||07-25-2000||01:07 PM||||Is there a kit anywhere that you can just POP OFF the side piece's of our sunroof's to make it look like a targa top???   MAKE SENSE???     Thank's for any info...  <P>                 Steve  85GT,87GT,842m4    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Old Lar||07-25-2000||03:51 PM||||The roof structure on a fiero is an integal part of holding the car together.  When you cut out the roof (convertible, targa) you lose that support.  You then need to reinforce the bottom of the car. <P>I know some people working on a targa concept using a coupe.  I know some people working on a convertible using a pop off top, rather than a canvas top.<P>The T-tops are the easist to convert to.  You still have a center structure holding the car together.||||reg||10
