Z||000005||pollock||07-26-2000||09:37 AM||||I'm in the process of installing a Ttop assembly right now.<P>The parts are pretty hard to come by.  I bought a complete "kit" from a dude that had parted out a Ttop car.  <P>There is a structural "H" frame that rivets in between the front and back halves of the roof.  It requires a lot of cutting of the original roof structure.  <P>In addition to the rivets, i chose to stitch weld the top surface of my H frame, across the front and back.  Just did that last night.<P>I will begin the trim work this weekend. It will take me a while to finish.  <P>I have taken some photos along the way.  I will post progress on this board, and plan to compile an "instruction manual" for this install.  Maybe Cliff would let me put it on his main board, next to Ogre's Cave. (hint)<P>Email me if you want to know more.||||reg||14
